oom Illumination MR", "keywords": ["Design", "Interior", "MR", "Relaxation", "Simulation"], "long_description": "Design your perfect ambiance.\n\nRoom Illumination MR is a Mixed Reality utility that allows you to experiment with lighting design in your own home without moving a single lamp. Using precise Hand Tracking, place virtual light sources anywhere in your room to see how they affect the mood and shadows.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\nVirtual Fixtures: Place lamps, spotlights, and colored LEDs on your real tables and walls.\nPassthrough Integration: The app scans your environment to ensure light interacts realistically with your furniture geometry.\nGesture Control: Adjust brightness and color temperature with simple hand gestures.\n\nCurrently in Early Access, this tool is perfect for visualizing new room layouts or simply relaxing in a custom-lit version of your home.\n", "short_description": "Visualize lighting setups in your physical space. An MR tool that lets you place virtual lamps and color sources in your room using Hand Tracking. Test shadows and ambiance instantly."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_mo